Day 4 – DevOps Learning Journey
📖 Project Overview

This project demonstrates how to use Vagrant provisioning to automate the setup of a web server.
Instead of manually installing packages and configuring Apache, everything is done automatically when we run:

vagrant up


The provisioning script installs Apache, downloads a template website, and serves it on the VM.

⚙️ Tech Stack

Vagrant – For VM lifecycle management

VirtualBox – VM provider

CentOS Stream 9 – Guest OS

Apache HTTP Server – Web server

Shell Script – Provisioning automation

