▶️ Setup & Usage

Clone this repository

git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/devops-day4-vagrant-provision.git
cd devops-day4-vagrant-provision


Start the VM

vagrant up


Access the website

If using private network: open http://192.168.20.30

If using forwarded port: open http://localhost:8080

Destroy VM when not needed

vagrant destroy -f

